  "the square-cube break said fitted metabolic exponents range from two thirds to one; Glazier treats those as bounds for most values and reports intraspecific exponents above one",
  "the handle-units break cited the seed linear solver as if it showed no unit check exists; the cite now names it as the solver the proposed bench would reuse, and the bench proposal is linked"
 ]
